node_modules/
platform/data/*.db
platform/data/*.db-wal
platform/data/*.db-shm
# Connection churn from cloudflared, rewritten every few seconds while a
# tunnel is up. It is a diagnostic to read when the site is unreachable,
# never a record of anything, and it buried 806 lines of noise in a diff
# that was otherwise empty.
review/platform.log
review/tunnel.log
_impeccable/

# The seed database. It is a real snapshot: names, phone numbers and email
# addresses of actual customers. Git history is forever and repositories
# get shared, so this stays out of it. The VPS deploy sends it over ssh
# instead (push.sh --first-time). If you ever move to a host that needs it
# committed, make certain the repository is private first.
deploy/seed/*.db

# Sample photographs suppliers upload. They belong on the server's disk,
# beside the database, not in the repository.
platform/data/uploads/
